OL,5,G0050 Killer on the Run
OL,6,     F...Belorusov. In London 2018,
OL,7,     FLaureline Garcia-Bertaux is found
OL,8,     Fmurdered in her garden. Detectives
OL,9,     Fpursue her ex-boyfriend, Kirill
OL,10,     FBelorusov, who flees to Estonia.
OL,11,G0150 #Text Me When You Get Home
OL,12,     FQueena Phu, 18, was brutally
OL,13,     Fattacked and left for dead after
OL,14,     Freturning a library book. Her
OL,15,     Ffriend Rachel found her
OL,16,     Funconscious. Queena survived - but
OL,17,     Fis permanently disabled.
